1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,964
Signing in starts here. If the password is gone, choose Forgot password?

2
00:00:02,964 --> 00:00:06,303
Enter the address you sign in with — the email already on your record.

3
00:00:06,303 --> 00:00:09,240
Choose Send reset link.

4
00:00:09,240 --> 00:00:12,836
It answers the same way for everyone — nobody can use this page to find out who works here.

5
00:00:12,836 --> 00:00:16,955
The email lands in a minute: one single-use link that expires in an hour.

6
00:00:16,955 --> 00:00:19,747
The link opens a page to choose a new password — ten characters or more.

7
00:00:19,747 --> 00:00:22,197
Type it a second time so a mistyped password cannot lock the account.

8
00:00:22,197 --> 00:00:26,704
Choose Reset password.

9
00:00:26,704 --> 00:00:29,704
Done — the reset signs you straight in. No second sign-in, and the old password is already dead.
